---
/** One line about Afnan between the work and the contact block. */
---
<section class="teaser" aria-label="About Afnan">
  <div class="container teaser__inner">
    <p class="dot-label">About</p>
    <p class="teaser__line">Product, brand and web designer with 5+ years of client work, an MDM from Toronto Metropolitan University and a BFA in Graphic Design. Off screen, I paint and illustrate.</p>
    <a class="teaser__link" href="/about/">More about me <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .teaser { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .teaser__inner { display: grid; gap: var(--space-s); padding-block: var(--space-2xl); justify-items: start; }
  .teaser__line { max-width: 44rem; font: 500 clamp(1.3rem, 1rem + 1.4vw, 2.1rem) / 1.3 var(--font-text); letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .teaser__link { min-height: 44px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .4rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--color-text); text-decoration: none; }
  .teaser__link:hover { color: var(--color-accent); }
</style>
